---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal notice SimulSejour: publisher, host and limits of use" description="Legal notice (mentions légales, Article 6 of the LCEN act) for SimulSejour, a site on French residence permits and citizenship: publisher, editor, host and limits." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information required by Article 6 of French Act no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 on confidence in the digital economy (LCEN) for {SITE_URL}. French law calls this page the mentions légales.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>Publication director</h2><p>{AUTHOR_NAME}, reachable at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Purpose and limits</h2>
    <p>The site explains the rules on entry, residence and access to French citizenship, and offers calculators that apply them (tax stamps, eligibility dates, family-reunification income, salary thresholds). It is independent of the administration, with no link to the Interior Ministry, the prefectures, OFII, the ANEF portal or any law firm. Results are general information, not legal advice and not a decision: only the competent authority rules on an application. The <a href={route('method', lang)}>method page</a> describes how we work.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Amounts and rules are re-read on the official sources after each reform and tested before every release, but the absence of errors cannot be guaranteed. Linked sites are the responsibility of their publishers; our external links lead to public sources. Please report errors through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>The texts and calculations on this site are protected. Public information taken from Service-Public.fr is reused under the Etalab Open Licence 2.0, with source and date. The calculator may be embedded free of charge: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed a calculator</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a>. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
